            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.15+1KI.7.16+1KI.7.17+1KI.7.18+1KI.7.19+1KI.7.20+1KI.7.21+1KI.7.22+1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 7:15-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.15+2CH.3.16+2CH.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Imila 3:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Kaludea batobaula inceshi sha mukuba, ne fyakuteekapo ifyashinguluka elyo ne cakusambilamo ca mukuba ifyali mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, basenda no mukuba ku Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 7:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Imila 4:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili basenda imipika, bafosholo, ifyakukushilamo imito, ifyakushimishako nangu ukukushishako ulubuuto, imbale elyo na fyonse ifipe fya mukuba ifyo balebomfya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukalamba wa bakalinda wa mfumu asendafye fyonse ifyapangilwe na golide na silifa, emukuti ne fifukilisho ne mbale umwalesumina umulopa we lambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asenda umukuba wa ku nceshi shibili, icakusambilamo, ne fyakutekapo ifyashinguluka ifyo Solomoni apangile ifya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, fyena fyalicililemo ukufina kanshi balifililwe no kufipima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cila luceshi lwalepele lumo lumo amakubiti ikumi limo na cine konse konse (18)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, lwalepele bamita cine konse konse (8m) ukulola mumulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Umutwe wa mukuba umo uwali pa mulu wa luceshi wali amakubiti yatatu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, mupepi na mita umo na citika (1.3m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ukulola mumulu, elyo ukushinguluka cila luceshi balengeleko amaluba ayasuma ayapala amateke aya mukuba. Uluceshi lwacibili nalo lwine lwali ulwapalana ku lubiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
