            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Nebusaradani umukalamba wa bakalinda asenda Seraya shimapepo mukalamba, Sefania shimapepo wamukonkelepo na bakalinda wa pa mwinshi wa ŋanda yakwa Yawe batatu ukuba abafungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bashelepo mu musumba, asenda uwaletungulula ifita elyo na bampandamano basano aba kwisano. Asenda na kalemba uwali cilolo mukalamba wa bashilika ba nkondo uwalesunga imilandu ya bulwi elyo na bambi abaume amakumi mutanda (60) abasangilwe mu musumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe Nebusaradani umukalamba wa bakalinda abatwala bonse ku mfumu ya ku Babiloni, iyali mu mushi wa Ribula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulya kwine ku Ribula, mu calo ca ku Hamati, eko imfumu yabepaila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi efyo abena Yuda baile muli bunkole, ukutali ne calo cabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesa imfumu ya ku Babiloni yasonta Gedalia umwana wakwa Ahikamu, mwana Shafyani ukuba umulashi wa bantu bashele mu Yuda abo bashasendeleko muli bunkole ku Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo bacilolo wa fita pamo na bantu babo baumfwa ukuti imfumu ya ku Babiloni naisonta Gedalia ukuba umulashi, baima baisa kuli Gedalia ku Misipa. Abaishile bali ni Ishimaeli mwana Netaniya, Yohanani mwana Karea, Seraya mwana Tanihumeti umwina Netofa, Yasaniya umwana wa mwina Makati elyo na bantu babo bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia alapa umulapo wakubalaya, bena pamo na bantu babo. Abeba nokuti, “Mwitiina bacilolo ba bena Kaludea, lelo iseni mwikale muno calo. Mulebombela imfumu ya ku Babiloni, ninshi na fyonse fili nokubafye bwino kuli imwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba mu mweshi walenga cine lubali, Ishimaeli umwana wakwa Netaniya, mwana Elishama uwali uwa ku bufumu aisa na bantu ikumi limo no kwisa ipaya Gedalia na baume abena Yuda elyo na bena Kaludea abali nankwe ku Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yere 43:5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali iyi nshita, abantu bonse ukufuma pa wacepesha ukufika na ku wacindamisha pamo pene na bacilolo wa bashilika babutukila ku Egupto pa mulandu wakutiina abena Kaludea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
