            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.31+JER.52.32+JER.52.33+JER.52.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yere 52:31-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walenga amakumi yatatu na cine lubali (37) apo basendele Yehoiyakini imfumu ya bena Yuda muli bunkole, pa bushiku bwalenga amakumi yabili na cine lubali (27) mu mweshi we kumi limo na ibili (12), emo imfumu Efili Merodaki atendeke ukuteeka pa bufumu bwa bena Babiloni. Abelela Yehoiyakini uluse, amufumya na mu cifungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efili Melodaki alemutentemba, alimupeele ne cipuna icacindamisha pa fipuna fya shamfumu shimbi shonse ishali pamo na Yehoiyakini muli bunkole mu Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yehoiyakini epakufula ifyakufwala fya mu cifungo, elyo na mu nshiku shonse isha bumi bwakwe lyonse alalya kwisano lya mfumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili imfumu Efili Melodaki yalemupeela ifintu fyonse ifyo alekabila cila bushiku pa nshiku shonse ishashele ku bumi bwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
